Reading activities. Reading activity 8; Reading activity 9

5
00:00:46.752 --> 00:00:54.938
Retell. Without looking back, give the main idea, three supporting details, and one reasonable inference in Spanish.

6
00:00:54.938 --> 00:01:22.028
Model language. El formulario pide el nombre y los apellidos. — The form asks for a first and last name. También pide el país de origen. — It also asks for the country of origin. La cita es el martes a las nueve y media. — The appointment is Tuesday at nine thirty. Elena confirma la fecha. — Elena confirms the date. Guarda el número de contacto. — She saves the contact number.

7
